# site-policy corpus
# Captured third-party policy text stays local — see corpus/README.md. `corpus/*` rather than
# `corpus/` so the negations below actually apply; git cannot re-include a file inside an
# ignored DIRECTORY.
corpus/*
!corpus/manifest.json
!corpus/curated.json
!corpus/analysis-index.json
!corpus/README.md
# Analyses are derived from third-party documents; same storage posture as the text.
# The committed record of what was analysed is corpus/analysis-index.json.

# Claude Code workspace
# Per-machine session state: local tool permissions and the browser-preview launch entry.
# Nothing in here describes the project, so it stays out of the repo.
.claude/
